    {
      "subId": "303008",
      "subQuestName": "(test)了解这段时空的海滩小屋孩子",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30300801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30300801": {
            "id": "30300801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "嗯？有人？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300802"
            ]
          },
          "30300802": {
            "id": "30300802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这种地方竟然有人在发呆！机会难得，我们不如就问他吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300803"
            ]
          },
          "30300803": {
            "id": "30300803",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "等等，谁在发呆啊！我是在想问题。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300804"
            ]
          },
          "30300804": {
            "id": "30300804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "骗人，你刚才眼神直直的，根本就是在走神嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300805"
            ]
          },
          "30300805": {
            "id": "30300805",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "欸？您怎么拿我开玩笑呢？都说了那不是发呆，是在考虑很多技术、环境之类的问题，这可是踏鞴砂啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300806"
            ]
          },
          "30300806": {
            "id": "30300806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喔，他说踏鞴砂呢，看来我们找对人了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300807"
            ]
          },
          "30300807": {
            "id": "30300807",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "怎么，二位是想问有关踏鞴砂的事情吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300808"
            ]
          },
          "30300808": {
            "id": "30300808",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么称呼你？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300809"
            ]
          },
          "30300809": {
            "id": "30300809",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "我叫泽维尔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300601"
            ]
          },
          "30300601": {
            "id": "30300601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你对踏鞴砂了解多吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "303007",
      "subQuestName": "(test)打听丹羽的故事",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30300701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30300701": {
            "id": "30300701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到啦，不过我们来这里是要找什么东西吗？还是说，找人？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300702"
            ]
          },
          "30300702": {
            "id": "30300702",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "#咦？{NICKNAME}和派蒙？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300703"
            ]
          },
          "30300703": {
            "id": "30300703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "泽维尔？你怎么在这里！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300704"
            ]
          },
          "30300704": {
            "id": "30300704",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "在这附近有事要办，就来了嘛。倒是二位，怎么也来这里了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30300705"
            ]
          },
          "30300705": {
            "id": "30300705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们有些事要打听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "303005",
      "subQuestName": "(test)偶遇泽维尔",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "303003",
      "subQuestName": "(test)回到城内询问NPC翔太",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "303001",
      "subQuestName": "(test)等待（改为跟床互动）",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "303010",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30301001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30301001": {
            "id": "30301001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到啦，这里是社奉行府，所以…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301002"
            ]
          },
          "30301002": {
            "id": "30301002",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "宏达",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，好久不见了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301003"
            ]
          },
          "30301003": {
            "id": "30301003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301004"
            ]
          },
          "30301004": {
            "id": "30301004",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "宏达",
            "text": "如果阁下是来找奉行大人和大小姐，实在不巧，他们都不在府中…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301005"
            ]
          },
          "30301005": {
            "id": "30301005",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是有公务吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301006"
            ]
          },
          "30301006": {
            "id": "30301006",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "宏达",
            "text": "奉行大人公务在身，大小姐则是替奉行大人出席一些会议，如有急事，可以到府内稍事休息，等候他们归来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301007"
            ]
          },
          "30301007": {
            "id": "30301007",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样？要进去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301008"
            ]
          },
          "30301008": {
            "id": "30301008",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那就打扰一下了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301009"
            ]
          },
          "30301009": {
            "id": "30301009",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "可以在院子里随便走走吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301010"
            ]
          },
          "30301010": {
            "id": "30301010",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "宏达",
            "text": "换作别人，当然是不可以的了。但您与奉行大人和大小姐关系甚佳，我想，应该没什么问题。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301011"
            ]
          },
          "30301011": {
            "id": "30301011",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "谢谢啦，那我们就进去了哦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301012"
            ]
          },
          "30301012": {
            "id": "30301012",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "嗯？您这样看着我，是有什么话要问我吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301013"
            ]
          },
          "30301013": {
            "id": "30301013",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "老婆婆，可以请教一些事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301014"
            ]
          },
          "30301014": {
            "id": "30301014",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "#呵呵，可以啊。我知道您是{NICKNAME}，大小姐跟我说起过您。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301015"
            ]
          },
          "30301015": {
            "id": "30301015",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "您有什么想知道的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301016"
            ]
          },
          "30301016": {
            "id": "30301016",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "奉行大人和大小姐最近好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301017"
            ]
          },
          "30301017": {
            "id": "30301017",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "托您的福，他们二位一切都好。大小姐近日忙于出席各色会议，时而帮奉行大人走访一下民间组织…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301018"
            ]
          },
          "30301018": {
            "id": "30301018",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "而奉行大人，您知道的，他总是忙得很，没什么变化。但要说的话，最近心情应是不错。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301019"
            ]
          },
          "30301019": {
            "id": "30301019",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "听起来一切如常，对吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301020"
            ]
          },
          "30301020": {
            "id": "30301020",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "是啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301021"
            ]
          },
          "30301021": {
            "id": "30301021",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（神里绫人依然担任社奉行，而神里绫华依然是奉行府的大小姐…与原先并无不同。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301022"
            ]
          },
          "30301022": {
            "id": "30301022",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（社奉行眼下的情况，似乎也没有什么变化…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301023"
            ]
          },
          "30301023": {
            "id": "30301023",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（虽然是意料中的结果，但听到他们兄妹一切都好的消息，还是觉得放心不少。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301024"
            ]
          },
          "30301024": {
            "id": "30301024",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样，还有其他要问的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301025"
            ]
          },
          "30301025": {
            "id": "30301025",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "暂时没有了，谢谢您。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301026"
            ]
          },
          "30301026": {
            "id": "30301026",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "您实在是太客气啦，要不是听说您也非常繁忙，我都想请您常来奉行府做客了呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301027"
            ]
          },
          "30301027": {
            "id": "30301027",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
            "text": "大小姐她啊，经常提起您。她似乎很高兴能有您这样的朋友，还说您各方面都很厉害，令人钦佩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30301028"
            ]
          },
          "30301028": {
            "id": "30301028",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "古田",
